================================================================================
SECTION: ABOUT (Future / Fire)

Vibe: A highly volatile, energy-dense engine room.
Goal: Introduce the user to your core narrative (AI + UI) while letting them
physically interact with the "heat" of your tech stack via the cursor.

GLOBAL CONTAINER & ARCHITECTURE

Background: #0F172A (Deep Matte Slate) - continues seamlessly from the Hero.

Ambient Lighting: A massive, subtle radial gradient fixed to the center-bottom
of the section to simulate a glowing core.
background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 100%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);

Layout: A strict absolute-positioned coordinate layout relative to the viewport.

LAYOUT ELEMENTS & TYPOGRAPHY

[ A. Section Header ]

Text: "ABOUT ME"

Positioning: Absolute, top-center of the viewport.

Typography: Syne, Size: 1.5rem, Weight: 700 (Bold), Color: #F97316 (Orange).

[ B. Left Column: 4 Information Boxes ]

Positioning: Absolute positioning spanning from 15vh to 90vh vertically, and anchored at 15vw on the left.

Layout: A flexbox column containing 4 distinct boxes that flex-grow equally to fill the height.

Box Content & Typography:
Header (Strong): Space Grotesk, 14px, #94A3B8, Uppercase.
Description (P): DM Sans, 1.25rem, #F8FAFC.

Box 1: "What I do"
